  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to the&#xa0;Global Alliance for Green and Gender Action (GAGGA)&#xa0;aims to support the core goals and activities of GAGGA, at the nexus of climate action and gender equality. The action addresses the interconnection between the two policy-priority themes of gender and climate, as well as the policy commitment to channel more resources to women-led, grassroots actors.&#xa0;GAGGA secures women&#x2019;s rights to water, food security, and a clean, healthy environment.</narrative>
  </description>
